Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 17:06:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(legal): rewire Executive Portal link + relay key to
 the real portal

Following the ep1.html deletion, case-strategist.html's launchEP()
and its chain-node button both pointed at the deleted static mock
instead of the real, functional exec portal at
war-rooms/legal-war/legal-executive-portal.html.

Two independent bugs, both fixed:
- Wrong destination: all 4 references to ep1.html rewired to the
  real exec portal file.
- Wrong relay key: case-strategist wrote sessionStorage under
  'tsm_legal_relay', but legal-executive-portal.html's
  loadStrategistRelay() only reads 'TSM_STRATEGIST_RELAY'. Rebuilt
  the payload to match the shape the portal actually consumes
  (ts, matter, docType, synthesisText, riskScore, enginesCount) using
  data already available in scope -- no fields invented for values
  we don't have (exposure, winProb left unset).

Also cleaned up two now-redundant 'eDiscovery Portal' catalog entries
in suite-builder.html and tsm-marketing-platform.html that would have
duplicated the 'Legal Executive Portal' entry after the URL fix.

Updated the tracker's Legal vfoot note to describe the real fix
instead of the prior 'not yet fixed' placeholder.
